{"protocol":"mindblown-brain/1","brain":"projects","page":{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo","title":"Hollow Pines Public Demo","type":"project","lobe":"pines","parent":"projects/hollow-pines","desc":"Browser demo at a custom domain with postcards players can share.","intro":"Browser demo at a custom domain with postcards players can share.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-13","synapses":["projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#1","projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#2","projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#3","projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#4","projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#5","projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#6","projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#7","projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#8","projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#9","projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#10","projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#11"],"sources":["pplx://sessions/e9302986-547b-52a0-a119-fa2c1be1e007","pplx://sessions/25aa76c9-12cf-99c4-77be-a704bdfb51ca","pplx://sessions/1dd36ee9-a66a-0725-f51b-4c54715b879e","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/hollow-pines/pull/42","https://example-store.test/listing-guide"],"sections":["How it works","See also"]},"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Fhollow-pines-public-demo","parent":{"id":"projects/hollow-pines","title":"Hollow Pines","type":"project","lobe":"pines","parent":null,"desc":"Hollow Pines is a cozy browser game about tending a forest cabin through four seasons, with a radio, a sky and visiting animals.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-17","synapses":24,"sources":4,"children":7,"links":9,"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Fhollow-pines","api":"api/projects/v1/pages/projects~2fhollow-pines.json"},"children":[],"synapses":[{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#1","page":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo","lead":"Honest draw budget limits","text":"Sam chose to keep the draw budget and the journal entry distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/25aa76c9-12cf-99c4-77be-a704bdfb51ca"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#2","page":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo","lead":"Save bundle stays explicit","text":"Sam chose to keep the save bundle and the draw budget distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/25aa76c9-12cf-99c4-77be-a704bdfb51ca"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#3","page":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo","lead":"Snowfall layer before frame-time breadcrumb","text":"Sam chose to keep the snowfall layer and the frame-time breadcrumb distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/e9302986-547b-52a0-a119-fa2c1be1e007"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#4","page":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo","lead":"Migration check stays explicit","text":"migration check changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check per season is bounded evidence, not proof that the save bundle works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://example-store.test/listing-guide"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#5","page":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo","lead":"No silent radio station changes","text":"Sam chose to keep the radio station and the save bundle distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#6","page":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo","lead":"One radio station, two surfaces","text":"Sam chose to keep the radio station and the postcard distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/e9302986-547b-52a0-a119-fa2c1be1e007","pplx://sessions/25aa76c9-12cf-99c4-77be-a704bdfb51ca"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#7","page":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo","lead":"Snowfall layer needs an owner choice","text":"the snowfall layer remembers per season, but this does not establish postcard acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/e9302986-547b-52a0-a119-fa2c1be1e007","https://example-store.test/listing-guide"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#8","page":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo","lead":"Postcard is not acceptance","text":"the postcard remembers between versions and surfaces a plain warning when the draw budget is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/hollow-pines/pull/42"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#9","page":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo","lead":"Bounded snowfall layer evidence","text":"the snowfall layer replays at dusk and surfaces a plain warning when the cabin lantern is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/25aa76c9-12cf-99c4-77be-a704bdfb51ca"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#10","page":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo","lead":"Honest cabin lantern limits","text":"the cabin lantern defers at dusk, but this does not establish postcard acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/e9302986-547b-52a0-a119-fa2c1be1e007"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo#11","page":"projects/hollow-pines-public-demo","lead":"Visitor routine survives rollback","text":"an earlier draft treated the visitor routine as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting t